// No-op instrumentation hooks for the browser build.
//
// Niobium's OpenFHE fork must be compiled with OPENFHE_CPROBES (key switching
// refuses to build without it), so every polynomial operation calls a probe.
// Natively libnbfhetch supplies them; the browser never records a trace, so
// these stand-ins do what libnbfhetch does when it is not recording: nothing,
// returning nullptr / false. In particular openfhe_cprobe_address() returns
// nullptr, and CopyValues(nullptr) is a no-op, exactly as in a native keygen.

